  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vibrant Information Barometer (VIBE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Vibrant Information Barometer is an annual study thattracks how information is produced, spread, consumed, and used. Information production and consumption have drastically changed since the early 2000s. The Vibrant Information Barometer builds on what we learned from nearly two decades of implementing the Media Sustainability Index. VIBE offers a fresh way to measure and diagnose the challenges and opportunities of todays complex information systems.</narrative>
  </description>
